    "body": "The note in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#img-environment-changes recommends running that algorithm with images get inserted into the document, which does run the source selection algorithm. That's basically what Gecko is doing, though I'd need to check how precisely we implement that algorithm, let me know if you'd need that.",
